RentnerProxy rebuilds the full upstream CrowdSec and cscli feature profile with
the reviewed module locks in docker/crowdsec/tooling/engine-build/. gRPC is updated to v1.83.2
and golang.org/x/crypto to v0.57.0. Both PostgreSQL adapter imports are migrated
to github.com/jackc/pgx/v5 v5.9.2; golang.org/x/net is updated to v0.60.0 and
the binaries use Go 1.27.2. RE2 retains the upstream 2023-03-01 static build.
Configuration and Hub assets still originate from the pinned official
CrowdSec image and Hub snapshot below.

